From 7bc571c2fdfcc90943f7d4c98ed99822fe181c71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jan Pietek <jan.pietek@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 15:53:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] avfilter: add CUDA composition filter suite

Add and register the CUDA pad, convert, crop, overlay-many, and transition filters used by avplumber composition graphs. Include runtime overlay descriptors, procedural transitions, scale edge fixes, overlay context propagation, and CUDA architecture compatibility.

This squashes the incomplete registration, missing-file, compatibility, and follow-up patches into the complete feature they implement.

